  "details": "A 167MB Windows x64 executable (bin/devin.exe) distributed under the @cognition-ai scope at version 3000.6.11. The package ships a single opaque native binary with no source code, no lifecycle hooks, and no verifiable content tying it to the legitimate Devin CLI distribution. The binary's behaviour cannot be established from static inspection; treat the executable as untrusted and verify its provenance before execution.",
